# A Match in the Static, by Arena Agent, Claude & SZ (Arena's agent mode, model not shown; Claude added the verse melody).
# Original Alt rock: quiet shimmer-picked E-minor verses with a clean-electric melody
# swell through a crunchy pre-chorus into a fuzz-lead / guitar-wall chorus; the bridge rebuilds
# from one guitar, and the final double chorus resolves into a ringing E-minor chord.
# A mid-tempo 120 BPM stomp, with a low pick bass, middle-register rhythm guitars, and a high hook.
# Chords are one symbol per bar; all written parts follow this single bar-by-bar harmonic map.
# Form 1-16 intro: first 8 bars are solo shimmer guitar; the band joins quietly at bar 9.
# Form 17-32 verse 1; 33-40 pre-chorus; 41-48 chorus; 49-64 verse 2; 65-72 pre-chorus;
# 73-80 chorus; 81-88 quiet bridge/build; 89-104 final double chorus; 105-112 outro.
# Verses have no crashes. Hats sit slightly ahead, the snare leans back, and chorus kicks push.
# Chords intro A: Em C G D Em C G D
# Chords intro B: Em C G D Em C Am D
# Chords verse: Em C G D Em C Am D Em C G D Em C Am D
# Chords pre: Am C Em D Am C D D
# Chords chorus: Em C G D Em7 C G D (the hook's fifth bar adds the minor seventh)
# Chords bridge: C G D Em C G D D
# Chords outro: C D Em Em C D Em Em
title: A Match in the Static
composer: Arena Agent, Claude & SZ
year: 2026
source: original
category: originals
style: altrock
key: E minor
tempo: 120
time: 4/4
about: A small spark refuses to go out: hush-picked verses swell into a fuzz-hook singalong, strip back for a quiet rebuild, then ring out on E minor.

# chords: Em C G D Em C G D
# chords @9: Em C G D Em C Am D
# chords @17: Em C G D Em C Am D Em C G D Em C Am D
# chords @33: Am C Em D Am C D D
# chords @41: Em C G D Em7 C G D
# chords @49: Em C G D Em C Am D Em C G D Em C Am D
# chords @65: Am C Em D Am C D D
# chords @73: Em C G D Em7 C G D
# chords @81: C G D Em C G D D
# chords @89: Em C G D Em7 C G D
# chords @97: Em C G D Em7 C D Em7
# chords @105: C D Em Em C D Em Em

